## The ask, in two tones by profile level (simple: Beginner and Intermediate; advanced).
## No suggested amounts, no guilt, goals, countdowns or comparisons.

apoio-titulo = Support Treasury
apoio-pedido-simples = Treasury is free and will stay that way. It's made by one person, and the code is open to anyone. If the app is helping your family and there's a little left over at the end of the month, you can support the person who makes it. The money goes straight to me and helps me keep Treasury secure and up to date. If there's nothing left over, that's fine: the app is yours all the same. Recommending it to someone or reporting a bug helps a lot too.
apoio-pedido-avancado = Treasury is free software, with no ads, no data selling, no tracking and no paid plan. It's maintained by one person. Donations go straight to me and pay for the AI tools, the research and the time I put into the app. In return, I commit to keeping it secure, up to date and well cared for. If the app is worth something to you, a small monthly contribution helps more than a large one-off.
apoio-obrigado = Thank you for your support. If you want to keep going, the link is here.

